    return <p>My Page</p>
  }
  ```

- Move the contents of `DashboardLayout` into a new [Client Component](/docs/app/getting-started/server-and-client-components) to retain `pages` directory behavior.

  ```jsx filename="app/dashboard/DashboardLayout.js"
